  "architectural_reading": "On the parity bipartition of F_2^4, the full octonion cross-space K8,8 splits into three disjoint layers: Q4 contributes degree mu=4, Mobius-Kantor contributes degree q=3, and the residual perfect matching contributes the identity degree. Thus 8 = mu + q + 1 and the heptad layer Phi_6 = mu + q is the Q4+MK edge carrier of size 56 = 2^q * Phi_6. This makes BT269/270's Hopf identity edge-level and explicit.",
